  "status": "present",
  "value": "A card is a string: rank (\"2\"..\"10\", \"J\", \"Q\", \"K\", \"A\") followed by a suit letter S, H, D or C; cards in the deck are distinct. deck holds exactly six cards dealt in order: cards 1, 3, 5 go to player 1 and cards 2, 4, 6 to player 2. Hand categories from strongest: three of a kind, pair, high card; ties within a category compare the triple rank, then the pair rank and kicker, then all ranks from highest to lowest; suits never matter. Return [hand1, hand2, winner] with the hands in deal order and winner 1, 2 or 0 for a draw.",
